Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value IPADDR (\S+)
Value ZONENAME (\S+)
Value VSYS (\S+)
Value HALP (\S\s\S\s\S\s\S)
Value MACADDRESS (\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)


Start
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IPADDR}\s+${ZONENAME}\s+${HALP}\s+${MACADDRESS}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IPADDR}\s+${ZONENAME}\s+${VSYS}\s+${HALP}\s+${MACADDRESS}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
